title: Take the "A" Train
key: C
tempo: 160
style: jazz

// Thirty-two bars, AABA. The A sections make the two chord a dominant with
// a flat five, two bars of it before the real two-five; the bridge sits on
// the four and comes back through the two as a dominant again.
